{aligned}2x+y &=3 \\\\ 6x+3y &=9 \\\\ -4x-2y &=-6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 3 & 9 \\\\ -4 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 3 & 9 \\\\ -4 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is one free variable, $y$. Therefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is consistent dependent."] [:db/add "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/answer-fields "51dbd002-9caa-59e9-8986-f6bf6a9143cf"] [:db/add "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/answer-fields "2380161b-b59e-5db4-9912-a328ceb92ebb"] [:db/add "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/answer-fields "c5cd8eb8-8434-5295-ba1c-693339b0f238"] [:db/add "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/answer-fields "2fcdf00d-5c37-5043-82f9-cd3bd17e17a0"] [:db/ensure "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186115299 :knowledge-point/questions "8bda5cea-f321-5119-aab4-e354ad5d9899"] [:db/add "22f09fd4-8a17-5f77-8aaa-7b4cac2d2f39" :answer/id #uuid "22f09fd4-8a17-5f77-8aaa-7b4cac2d2f39"] [:db/add "22f09fd4-8a17-5f77-8aaa-7b4cac2d2f39" :answer