49286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1"] [:db/add "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x-y-2z &=1 \\\\ x+\\frac{1}{2}y+z &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & -1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y+0z=1,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is inconsistent."] [:db/add "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/answer-fields "9310d490-05df-5094-a5e9-b8751fe630df"] [:db/add "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/answer-fields "4a9a8084-e54c-57a6-a187-6f709b15c316"] [:db/add "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/answer-fields "c11886bd-2ff0-5400-a530-d8043ec17846"] [:db/ensure "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186115299 :knowledge-point/questions "ce349286-3078-503c-a3d7-b0ae10d0caf1"] [:db/add "c7a50776-61f8-5a8e-b5fe-1a9b47dd27c8" :answer/id #uuid "c7a50776-61f8-5a8e-b5fe-1a9b47dd27c8"] [:db/add "c7a50776-61f8-5a8e-b5fe-1a9b47dd27c8" :an