"8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5"] [:db/add "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+y+3z &=4 \\\\ x-\\frac{1}{2}y-\\frac{3}{2}z &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} & -5\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} & -5\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y+0z=-3,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is inconsistent."] [:db/add "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/answer-fields "a96a2964-fd05-57f0-b621-f9c8c819b64f"] [:db/add "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/answer-fields "cad5a0d3-219c-59e6-ad2f-8885dde97589"] [:db/add "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/answer-fields "57e68633-b84e-518f-bff2-a73d5f130307"] [:db/ensure "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186115299 :knowledge-point/questions "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5"] [:db/add "b4e18cbd-85bd-569e-bb51-71ca318aad90" :answer/id #uuid "b4e18cbd-85bd-569e-bb51-71ca318aad90"] [:db/add "b4e18cbd-85bd-569e-bb51-71ca318aa