d #uuid "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373"] [:db/add "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+5y &=-11 \\\\ -x+2y &=-4 \\\\ x-3y &=7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & 5 & -11 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 7\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & 5 & -11 \\\\ -1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1}↔{R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 5 & -11 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(1){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is consistent independent."] [:db/add "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373" :question/answer-fields "28651d72-c06e-56c0-a175-73b31a3c9afb"] [:db/add "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373" :question/answer-fields "35a4a927-0607-5827-b062-f3254e5c80a8"] [:db/add "32cdb33c-5637-59fc-8a01-d05ed6dad373" :question/answer-fields "9fdce7dc-68d9-5c9a